  "description": "Antlers in the office?  \nAs a carrier of the “Minotaur Syndrome,” Noon has the antlers and head of an animal. He finally manages to land a job, only to find his new office covered in foliage and the other employees with the same condition as him! Will he be able to make it through this new chapter in life in one piece?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/55108820), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5509521), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/2404002173), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/ppulppul), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000047429), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=0zsa), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H040236716), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H040236716), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/5395) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://manta.net/en/series/horns-horns-everywhere?seriesId=1458), [Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0C2PG7RMW/)",
